sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser
    participant App as Next.js
    participant Auth as Auth Server

    Note over Auth: [INFERENCE] GitHub + Google share this grant role
    Browser->>App: GET /login/{github|google}
    App->>App: mint state, nonce, PKCE S256
    App-->>Browser: 302 + Set-Cookie
    Browser->>Auth: GET /authorize
    Auth-->>Browser: 302 /auth/{p}/callback?code&state
    Browser->>App: GET /auth/{p}/callback
    Note over App: [FACT] GitHub nonce before token<br/>[FACT] Google nonce in id_token after token
    App->>Auth: POST /token + code_verifier
    Auth-->>App: access_token (+ id_token)
    App-->>Browser: 302 /profile + session
